	(text "Thermal calcs (from datasheet):\nMax current output (3A)\nEfficiency: 89%\nPower: 3*5*0.11 = 1.65W\n40C/W = 66C rise\nWorks up to 125C\n\nCREDIT: LoRA Board (Arda Caliskan)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 183.388 81.026 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "0c8e38b7-488b-41d3-bd3c-9af02c3379f6")
	)
	(text "Peak 470mA at 5V -> 220mA at 12V with 89% efficiency\nWith max temperature deratings at 60C being 0.67,\n220mA/0.67 = 330mA hold current. \nSelect resettable fuse with 350mA hold current. \nTrip current 750mA.\n\nMOSFET junction-to-ambient is worst case\n125 C/W, 50mOhm at 0.5A gives 130uW, \nwhich gives a temp rise of 1.6C of MOSFET\n\nCREDIT: LoRA Board (Arda Caliskan)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 162.306 154.178 0)
		(effects
